==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|hlaupa|lang=non}}, from {{proto|gem-pro|hlaupanan|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈl̥øyːpa/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|øyːpa|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|hljóp|hlupu|hlaupið}}

# {{intransitive}} to [[run]]
# {{intransitive|of clothing}} to [[shrink]]
# {{intransitive|of rivers}} to [[flood]]
# {{intransitive}} to [[congeal]], to turn to [[jelly]]{{jump|is|congeal|s}}

====Derived terms====
* [[hlaup]]
* [[hlaupa á glæ]]
* [[hlaupa á sig]]
* [[hlaupa eins og fætur toga]]
* [[hlaupast]]
* [[hlaupast undan merkjum]] (to desert)

====Related terms====
* [[hleypa]]

====Synonyms====
* {{jump|s|is|congeal}} [[storkna]]

