==Old Norse==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|gem-pro|hlaupanan|lang=non}}, whence also Old English {{term|hleapan|hlēapan}} ( > English {{term|leap}}), Old Saxon {{term|hlopan|hlōpan}}, Old Frisian {{term|hlapa}}, Dutch {{term|lopen}}, Old High German {{term|hlaufan}} ( > German {{term|laufen}}).

===Verb===
{{head|non|verb}} (''strong conjugation:'' [[hljóp]] – [[hljópu]] – [[hlaupit]])

# to [[leap]], [[jump]], [[spring]]

